sequenceDiagram
    participant Doctor
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant QO as QueueOrchestrator
    participant CS as ChargeSourcesService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Doctor->>Web: Press "Complete visit", then confirm
    Web->>API: Flush pending notes and prescription saves
    Web->>API: PATCH /queue/entries/:id/complete with If-Match version
    API->>QO: complete
    QO->>DB: Lock entry, move in_consultation to completed
    QO->>DB: Mark booked appointment completed
    QO->>CS: syncForEncounter in the same transaction
    CS->>DB: Skip if billing.invoices is off, else read encounter and treatments
    CS->>DB: Insert consultation and treatment charges, ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    CS->>DB: Void unbilled charges whose treatment is gone, write billing audit
    QO->>DB: Queue event and outbox row, commit
    API-->>Web: Entry result, no charge data
    Web-->>Doctor: Toast "Visit completed", back to My Queue
